      value="&lt;b&gt;4. Enterprise relay pushes data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Consume outbound topic&lt;br&gt;Call vendor-confirmed intake API&lt;br&gt;Idempotency key, retries and delivery ledger">
