      value="&lt;b&gt;6. Record acceptance / commit outbound&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;After verified durable vendor intake&lt;br&gt;Persist receipt and commit safe relay offsets&lt;br&gt;Acceptance is not vendor processing completion">
