      value="&lt;b&gt;10. Receive availability notification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Authenticate, validate and deduplicate&lt;br&gt;Persist pull work / trigger pull adapter&lt;br&gt;Notification is a hint, not result data">
      <mxGeometry x="780" y="80" width="310" height="140" as="geometry"/>
