      value="&lt;b&gt;11. Enterprise pulls vendor results&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Read saved source cursor / positions&lt;br&gt;Fetch vendor feed pages or records&lt;br&gt;Periodic catch-up also detects missed notifications">
