      value="&lt;b&gt;12. Validate and publish inbound results&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Authorization, schema, correlation and identity&lt;br&gt;Normalize while preserving result ID/version&lt;br&gt;Quarantine invalid data without silent loss">
      <mxGeometry x="1590" y="80" width="330" height="140" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

