      value="&lt;b&gt;7. Process and persist outcome&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Vendor-owned business workflow&lt;br&gt;Idempotent effects and source-version rules&lt;br&gt;Persist outcome and result outbox atomically where feasible">
