      value="&lt;b&gt;9. Notify result availability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only after result is durably retrievable&lt;br&gt;Use confirmed notification interface&lt;br&gt;Retry safely; minimize notification PHI">
      <mxGeometry x="780" y="70" width="310" height="140" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>

